{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-35527","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38619","text":"Agentelic — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-35528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38620","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-38621","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-38622","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-38623","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-38624","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-38625","text":" Full Implementation (Build Pipeline + MCP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-35529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38626","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35530","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38627","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-35531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38628","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-38629","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-38630","text":" — the engineering layer of the [&] Protocol dark factory pipeline. Agentelic takes SpecPrompt specifications as input and produces tested, deployable agent artifacts through a deterministic 4-stage pipeline with template-based code generation."}]},{"id":"blk-35532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38631","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-38632","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-35533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38633","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-38634","marks":["bold"],"text":"build stage"},{"id":"spn-38635","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-35534","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-35535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38636","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35536","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38637","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-35537","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:   Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nPipeline:   4-stage build (PARSE → TEST INTAKE → GENERATE → COMPILE/TEST)\nMCP:        JSON-RPC over HTTP (agent_create, agent_build, agent_test, agent_deploy,\n            agent_status, template_list, template_pin, spec_validate, test_explain)\nDatabase:   PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (agentelic.* schema, migration range 080-089)\nAuth:       Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTesting:    ExUnit + deterministic test DSL from spec acceptance criteria\nDeploy:     Fly.io (MCP server + build pipeline worker)"},{"id":"blk-35538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38638","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35539","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38639","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-35540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38640","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-38641","marks":["code"],"text":"agentelic.com/"},{"id":"spn-38642","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-35541","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentelic.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── agentelic/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex              # Agentelic.Agents.Agent Ecto schema (section 4.4.1)\n│   │   ├── builds/\n│   │   │   └── build.ex              # Agentelic.Builds.Build Ecto schema (section 4.4.2)\n│   │   ├── testing/\n│   │   │   ├── test_run.ex           # Agentelic.Testing.TestRun schema (section 4.4.3)\n│   │   │   ├── test_result.ex        # Agentelic.Testing.TestResult embedded schema\n│   │   │   ├── dsl.ex                # Agentelic.Test.DSL — test case generation from specs\n│   │   │   ├── runner.ex             # Agentelic.Testing.Runner — execute tests with mocks\n│   │   │   └── compiled_intake.ex    # Agentelic.Testing.CompiledIntake — SpecPrompt test bridge\n│   │   ├── deploy/\n│   │   │   └── deployment.ex         # Agentelic.Deploy.Deployment schema (section 4.4.4)\n│   │   ├── pipeline/\n│   │   │   ├── orchestrator.ex       # Agentelic.Pipeline.Orchestrator — 4-stage pipeline runner\n│   │   │   ├── parser.ex             # Stage 1: PARSE — SpecPrompt.Spec parsing\n│   │   │   ├── test_intake.ex        # Stage 1.5: TEST INTAKE — compiled test loading\n│   │   │   ├── generator.ex          # Stage 2: GENERATE — template-based code generation\n│   │   │   ├── compiler.ex           # Stage 3: COMPILE — build artifact\n│   │   │   └── tester.ex             # Stage 4: TEST — run deterministic tests\n│   │   ├── templates/\n│   │   │   ├── registry.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Registry — template version management\n│   │   │   ├── manifest.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Manifest — template manifest schema\n│   │   │   └── renderer.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Renderer — EEx template expansion\n│   │   ├── triggers/\n│   │   │   ├── supabase_listener.ex  # Listen for spec.specs inserts via Supabase Realtime\n│   │   │   ├── cloudevents.ex        # Accept CloudEvents webhooks\n│   │   │   └── github_webhook.ex     # Accept GitHub push events on SPEC.md changes\n│   │   ├── publisher.ex              # Emit ConsolidationEvent to FleetPrompt on build success\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex             # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 4.5)\n│   │       └── tools.ex              # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── agentelic.ex                  # Application entry point\n│   └── agentelic_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                 # Phoenix router (API + webhook endpoints)\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── pipeline_controller.ex # POST /api/pipeline/trigger, /api/pipeline/github\n│           └── agent_controller.ex   # REST API for agents\n├── test/\n│   ├── pipeline/\n│   │   ├── parser_test.exs\n│   │   ├── generator_test.exs\n│   │   └── tester_test.exs\n│   ├── testing/\n│   │   ├── dsl_test.exs\n│   │   └── compiled_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── templates/\n│   │   └── registry_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_spec.md  # Customer-support SPEC.md from SpecPrompt section 3.3\n│       └── compiled_tests.json       # Pre-compiled test assertions\n├── priv/\n│   └── templates/                    # Bundled default templates (small set for MVP)\n│       ├── elixir/\n│       │   └── mcp-server/\n│       │       ├── template.json\n│       │       ├── mix.exs.eex\n│       │       └── lib/agent.ex.eex\n│       └── typescript/\n│           └── mcp-server/\n│               ├── template.json\n│               ├── package.json.eex\n│               └── src/agent.ts.eex\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-35542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38643","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35543","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38644","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-35544","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38645","text":"Phase 0: Foundation (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-35545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38646","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-38647","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-38648","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config 2. "},{"id":"spn-38649","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-38650","text":" (sections 4.4.1-4.4.4)"}]},{"id":"blk-35546","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38651","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-38652","text":" with workspace_id, user_id, product_type, status state machine"}]}],"id":"blk-35547","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38653","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Builds.Build"},{"id":"spn-38654","text":" with template_version, template_hash, compiled_tests_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-35549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38655","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Testing.TestRun"},{"id":"spn-38656","text":" with workspace_id, compiled_tests_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-35551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38657","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Deploy.Deployment"},{"id":"spn-38658","text":" with workspace_id, governance_policy_hash, approved_by"}]}],"id":"blk-35553","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38659","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-38660","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement spec parser"},{"id":"spn-38661","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-38662","marks":["code"],"text":"pipeline/parser.ex"},{"id":"spn-38663","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-35556","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38664","text":"Consume SpecPrompt SPEC.md files → "},{"id":"spn-38665","marks":["code"],"text":"SpecPrompt.Spec"},{"id":"spn-38666","text":" struct"}]}],"id":"blk-35557","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38667","text":"Compute spec_hash (SHA-256)"}]}],"id":"blk-35559","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38668","text":"Validate required sections"}]}],"id":"blk-35561","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38669","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-38670","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement CLI"},{"id":"spn-38671","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-38672","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_create"},{"id":"spn-38673","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38674","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_build"},{"id":"spn-38675","text":", "},{"id":"spn-38676","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_status"},{"id":"spn-38677","text":" commands"}]},{"id":"blk-35564","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38678","text":"Phase 0.5: Templates (weeks 6-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-35565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38679","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-38680","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement template registry"},{"id":"spn-38681","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-38682","marks":["code"],"text":"templates/registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-38683","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-35566","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38684","text":"List templates by "},{"id":"spn-38685","marks":["code"],"text":"{framework, product_type}"}]}],"id":"blk-35567","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38686","text":"Version pinning: agent-level > workspace-level > global default"}]}],"id":"blk-35569","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38687","text":"Template immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-35571","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38688","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-38689","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement template manifest"},{"id":"spn-38690","text":" schema and validation 3. "},{"id":"spn-38691","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement template renderer"},{"id":"spn-38692","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-38693","marks":["code"],"text":"templates/renderer.ex"},{"id":"spn-38694","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-35574","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38695","text":"EEx-based template expansion"}]}],"id":"blk-35575","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38696","text":"Input: "},{"id":"spn-38697","marks":["code"],"text":"SpecPrompt.Spec"},{"id":"spn-38698","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-38699","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-38700","text":" + template files"}]}],"id":"blk-35577","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38701","text":"Output: generated source files"}]}],"id":"blk-35579","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38702","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-38703","marks":["bold"],"text":"Bundle starter templates"},{"id":"spn-38704","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-38705","marks":["code"],"text":"priv/templates/"}]},{"id":"blk-35582","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38706","text":"Phase 1: Testing Framework (weeks 9-14)"}]},{